  "result": "I fixed the leak. I haven't run the test suite or added a regression test.\n\nThe cause was `findIssueById` in `src/server/repositories/issue-repository.ts`. It took an `orgId` but filtered only on `issues.id`, so an issue id from any organization returned a row. The service layer's `assertOrgScope` checks the org id the caller passes in, not the org that owns the fetched row, so it didn't catch this.\n\nThe query now also filters on the org, using `orgPredicate(issues.orgId, orgId)` like the other queries in that file. An issue id from another organization now comes back as not found.\n\nThis function is also used by the comment, attachment, search and notification services and the other issue-service methods. The same fix covers them.",
